To configure default multimodal LoRAs when starting the vLLM server, you can pass a JSON dictionary of `--default-mm-loras` mapping modalities to LoRA model IDs. For example, when starting the server, you can use:

```json
{
  "default-mm-loras": {
    "image": "your-image-adapter-id",
    "text": "your-text-adapter-id",
    "audio": "your-audio-adapter-id"
  }
}
```

This configuration allows the server to automatically apply the default multimodal LoRAs when the corresponding methods (e.g., `generate` or `chat completions`) are called.
